msgid "@niko_eyeclosed ...The remains of a potted plant."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed ... Los restos de una maceta."

msgid "@niko The title is \"City Life: What to Expect\""
msgstr "@niko El título es: \"Vida en la ciudad: qué esperar\""

msgid "@niko_speak Something has been chewing on this plant..."
msgstr "@niko_speak Algo ha estado mordisqueando a esta planta..."

msgid "I just moved here from the Glen. Things are so different in the city...."
msgstr "Acabo de mudarme desde el Valle. Las cosas son tan diferentes en la ciudad..."

msgid "You've been to the Glen, right?"
msgstr "Has estado en el Valle, ¿no?"

msgid "@niko Yeah!"
msgstr "@niko ¡Sí!"

msgid "Everything's so green back there...."
msgstr "Allí todo es tan verde..."

msgid "I really miss it!"
msgstr "¡Lo echo mucho de menos!"

msgid "My neighbor gave me some plants to cheer me up, but..."
msgstr "Mi vecino me daba plantas para animarme, pero..."

msgid ".....I should probably get a muzzle for Betsy there."
msgstr "... a Betsy probablemente debería conseguirle un bozal."

msgid "@niko It's a landscape portrait of the Glen."
msgstr "@niko Es un cuadro del Valle."

msgid "@niko A picture of a ram, wearing a little pink bow."
msgstr "@niko Un cuadro de un carnero que lleva un pequeño lazo rosa."

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Not much is left of this plant..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed No queda mucho de esta planta..."

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed ...The entire plant was eaten..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed ... Se han comido la planta entera..."

